{"kind":"html","caption":"同时维护两个指针，每次比较当前节点，把较小值接到结果链表末尾并前进一步。某条链表耗尽后，直接拼接另一条链表的剩余部分；示例最终得到 [1,1,2,3,4,4]。使用虚拟头节点可以统一处理结果链表为空和首次连接节点的情况。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>合并两个有序链表</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}.panel{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;margin-top:8px}.title{font-size:14px;color:#d4d4d4;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600}.hint{margin:0;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.status{color:#d4d4d4;margin-bottom:6px;padding:8px 10px;background:#2a2d2e;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px}.row{margin-bottom:8px}.label{display:block;color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:10px}.list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:4px}.node{min-width:40px;padding:4px 6px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}.number{display:block;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#d4d4d4}.meta{display:block;min-height:14px;margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.arrow{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.node.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.node.current .number,.node.current .meta{color:#fff}.node.used{background:#2d2d30;border-color:#3c3c3c}.node.used .number{color:#8d8d8d}.result .node{border-color:#3794ff}.result .node.latest{background:#0e639c;color:#fff}.empty{padding:6px 8px;border:1px dashed #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;margin-right:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #3c3c3c}.dot.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.progress{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px}.bar{height:100%;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}</style></head><body><main><section class=\"panel\"><h1 class=\"title\">逐个比较并连接较小节点</h1><p class=\"hint\">示例：l1 = [1,2,4]，l2 = [1,3,4]</p></section><section class=\"panel\"><div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div><div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">链表 l1</span><div id=\"l1\" class=\"list\"></div></div><div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">链表 l2</span><div id=\"l2\" class=\"list\"></div></div><div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">结果链表（虚拟头节点之后）</span><div id=\"result\" class=\"list result\"></div></div><div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot active\"></i>当前比较节点</span><span><i class=\"dot\"></i>尚未处理节点</span></div><div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"bar\" class=\"bar\"></div></div></section></main><script>const a=[1,2,4],b=[1,3,4];const steps=[{i:0,j:0,out:[],msg:'两个指针从链表头开始，比较 1 和 1。'},{i:1,j:0,out:[1],msg:'取 l1 的 1，结果尾指针随之移动。'},{i:1,j:1,out:[1,1],msg:'比较 2 和 1，取 l2 的 1。'},{i:2,j:1,out:[1,1,2],msg:'比较 2 和 3，取 l1 的 2。'},{i:2,j:2,out:[1,1,2,3],msg:'比较 4 和 3，取 l2 的 3。'},{i:3,j:2,out:[1,1,2,3,4],msg:'两个值都是 4，先连接 l1 的 4。'},{i:3,j:3,out:[1,1,2,3,4,4],msg:'l1 已耗尽，直接拼接 l2 剩余节点，合并完成。'}];let s=0;function drawList(id,data,p){const root=document.getElementById(id);root.innerHTML='';if(!data.length){root.innerHTML='<span class=\"empty\">空链表</span>';return}data.forEach((v,k)=>{if(k)root.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>');const n=document.createElement('div');n.className='node '+(k<p?'used':k===p?'current':'');n.innerHTML='<span class=\"number\">'+v+'</span><span class=\"meta\">'+(k===p?'指针 · 下标 '+k:'下标 '+k)+'</span>';root.appendChild(n)})}function render(){const x=steps[s];drawList('l1',a,x.i);drawList('l2',b,x.j);const r=document.getElementById('result');r.innerHTML='';if(!x.out.length){r.innerHTML='<span class=\"empty\">暂为空</span>'}else{x.out.forEach((v,k)=>{if(k)r.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>');const n=document.createElement('div');n.className='node '+(k===x.out.length-1?'latest':'');n.innerHTML='<span class=\"number\">'+v+'</span><span class=\"meta\">'+(k===x.out.length-1?'结果尾节点':'已连接')+'</span>';r.appendChild(n)})}document.getElementById('status').textContent='步骤 '+(s+1)+' / '+steps.length+'：'+x.msg;document.getElementById('bar').style.width=((s+1)/steps.length*100)+'%'}render();setInterval(()=>{s=(s+1)%steps.length;render()},2000);</script></body></html>","svg":"","media":"","time_complexity":"O(m+n)","space_complexity":"O(1)","complexity_note":"m、n 为两条链表的节点数. 迭代比较并重新连接原节点, 一条链表耗尽后直接接上剩余部分; 仅增加一个 dummy 节点, 不复制结果节点."}
